liquidate.tree
├── when market is paused
│   └── it should revert with MarketPaused
└── when market is not paused
    ├── given borrower has no debt
    │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketNothingToLiquidate
    ├── given borrower position is healthy (LTV below liquidation threshold)
    │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketPositionHealthy
    └── given borrower position is liquidatable
        ├── given position is not tagged
        │   ├── when liquidator is priority liquidator
        │   │   ├── given within priority grace period
        │   │   │   ├── it should liquidate position
        │   │   │   ├── it should burn borrow tokens from liquidator
        │   │   │   ├── it should transfer collateral to liquidator
        │   │   │   ├── it should reduce borrower debt
        │   │   │   └── it should emit Liquidate event
        │   │   └── given after priority grace period
        │   │       └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketLiquidationUnauthorized
        │   └── when liquidator is not priority liquidator
        │       └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketLiquidationUnauthorized
        └── given position is tagged
            ├── when liquidator is priority liquidator
            │   ├── given within priority grace period
            │   │   ├── it should liquidate position
            │   │   ├── it should burn borrow tokens from liquidator
            │   │   ├── it should transfer collateral to liquidator
            │   │   ├── it should reduce borrower debt
            │   │   └── it should emit Liquidate event
            │   └── given after priority grace period
            │       └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketLiquidationUnauthorized
            ├── when liquidator is tagger
            │   ├── given within tagger grace period after priority period
            │   │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketLiquidationUnauthorized
            │   └── given after tagger grace period
            │       ├── it should liquidate position
            │       ├── it should burn borrow tokens from liquidator
            │       ├── it should transfer collateral to liquidator
            │       ├── it should reduce borrower debt
            │       └── it should emit Liquidate event
            └── when liquidator is neither priority nor tagger
                ├── given within liquidation window
                │   └── it should revert with AltoBorrowMarketLiquidationUnauthorized
                └── given after liquidation window
                    ├── it should liquidate position
                    ├── it should burn borrow tokens from liquidator
                    ├── it should transfer collateral to liquidator
                    ├── it should reduce borrower debt
                    └── it should emit Liquidate event 